| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 16 | 1.35e-08 | 1.70e-07 | 0.62 | 9.54e-07 |
| 64 | 1.36e-08 | 1.93e-07 | 1.18 | 3.81e-06 |
| 256 | 1.31e-08 | 2.33e-07 | 2.27 | 1.53e-05 |
